  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">COLOMBIA-FINANCIAL AND PERFORMANCE MANAGEMENT SYSTEMS CAPACITY BUILDING FOR PUBLIC RURAL FINANCIAL INSTITUTES</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Develop precise specifications for and build the capacity of Banco Agrario and Fogacoop to implement financial and performance monitoring systems which will allow them to continuously track and analyze sustainability and outreach and make strategic operational changes based on this analysis.  These activities are in line with IDF focus area, specifically as related to Public Expenditure Management and Financial Accountability.  As outlined in the IDF guidelines, the activities to be conducted through this grant will support improved financial accountability and oversight of the two institutions, so that scarce government resources are better managed and more effectively applied. The purpose of the Grant is to develop precise specifications to build the capacity of Banco Agrario and FOGACOOP to implement financial and performance monitoring systems which will allow them to continuously track and analyze sustainability and outreach and make strategic operational changes based on this analysis.</narrative>
  </description>
